# Build output. `Cargo.lock` is tracked: tests and benchmarks build the same dependency versions on every machine.
# Proptest's `*.proptest-regressions` files are tracked too: a failure found once is replayed on every run after it.
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Operating systems
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Python: the environments the binding's check makes, the build output, the caches of its tools.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.so
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
